---
import { practicalDownloads } from '../data/practicalDownloads';
const root = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<section class="guide-downloads-section" aria-labelledby="guide-downloads-title">
  <div class="guide-downloads-heading">
    <span class="eyebrow">PRACTICAL FILES</span>
    <h3 id="guide-downloads-title">實務文件與範本</h3>
    <p>整理實際計畫案例與可下載的工作表格，協助你從閱讀走向實作。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="files">
    {practicalDownloads.map(file => (
      <div class="file-row">
        <div class="guide-file-desc">
          <strong>{file.name}</strong>
          <span>{file.type}</span>
          <p class="muted small">{file.desc}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="file-actions">
          {file.preview && <a class="file-preview-link" href={root + file.path} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">線上閱讀</a>}
          <a href={root + file.path} download>下載文件 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
  <aside class="notice">提醒：以上文件是實務參考案例，不代表政府機關核定格式。申請補助或辦理核銷時，請優先使用各計畫提供的正式表單。</aside>
</section>
